ch", "created": 1794694764580, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "sanitaryshaver", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "If I were Elon Musk, I'd change SpaceX terms of service to include permanent and irrevokable banning people from starlink for \"threatening SpaceX and its employees with lawfare; producing narratives that seek to harm SpaceX and its employees.\"   Or revokable, subject to 100k forgiveness fees for vio", "last_comment_created": 1794708321960, "content": "<p>If I were Musk, I'd change community violations at spaceX to include &quot;manufacturing narratives seeking to harm SpaceX, its employees, board members, and Musk&quot;, &quot;threatening SpaceX and its employees with lawfare&quot;</p>\n<p>And I'd ban employees of entire media outlets, starting with the news host and everyone who works for them, and then I'd get an employee list and ban them, forever, off the spaceX platform.</p>\n<p>Basically an enemies list. They don't get to use starlink.</p>\n<p>Also, they don't get to use Elon Musk's future starlink based mobile service</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 3, "score_up": 71, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToiHTlBe", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 36, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "truth", "id": 8940446, "raw_content": "", "author": "I-am-Orlando", "created": 1794708061358, "profile_pic